5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
EvidenceTune asked 208 times.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
In this chosen example, the quote is about returning copies, not rights.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Plain training switches.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,000
EvidenceTune asks for the source.

9
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:37,000
The released alpha point seven five merge, on the same local backend,

10
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:47,000
passes 222 of 240 semantic rows and 253 of 270 targeted rows, versus version seven’s 213 and 247: recorded proxy confirmations.

11
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Scope: synthetic proxy tests only.

12
